    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Sasha apologizes for something she did not mean to do and fears being fired. Max comforts her, says he will tell no one and tells her to keep working. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'to want' and 'truth' — you will catch every word right away. See you in the next scene.",
